<view class="top" style="padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px">
  <view class="nav" style="height: {{navHeight}}px">
    <view class="nav-back" bindtap="back" aria-role="button" aria-label="返回"><t-icon name="chevron-left" size="48rpx" color="#FFFFFF" /></view>
    <text class="nav-title">查名单</text>
  </view>
  <view class="h1">这家企业上过哪些名单？</view>
  <view class="sub">高新技术企业、专精特新、科技型中小企业等，公示和正式公布分开标注</view>
  <notice-bar onBlue="{{true}}" align="left" />
  <view class="search">
    <t-icon name="search" size="36rpx" color="#86909C" />
    <input class="search-input" value="{{name}}" placeholder="输入企业全称或统一社会信用代码" confirm-type="search" bindinput="onInput" bindconfirm="query" aria-label="企业全称或统一社会信用代码" />
    <view class="search-btn" bindtap="query">查询</view>
  </view>
  <view class="batch">批量比对：粘贴多个企业全称，一次查完 · 即将上线</view>
</view>
<view class="note">按企业全称逐行比对名单原文；名称相近的企业分开列出，请核对统一社会信用代码。只查企业和机构，不查个人。</view>

<view wx:if="{{queried}}" class="card result">
  <view class="section-title">"{{queried}}" 的查询结果</view>
  <view class="muted result-text">名单明细正在整理，接口就绪后这里会列出该企业入选的名单、批次、公示或正式公布状态和原文链接。</view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="section-title">最近发布的名单<text class="weak count">本周 {{weekTotal}} 份</text></view>
  <view class="chips">
    <view wx:for="{{chips}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{chip === item ? 'chip--on' : ''}}" data-chip="{{item}}" bindtap="pickChip">{{item}}</view>
    <view class="chip">更多 ▾</view>
  </view>
  <view class="rows">
    <doc-row wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" doc="{{item}}" last="{{index === items.length - 1}}" today="{{today}}" />
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{items.length < total}}" class="load-more">已显示 {{items.length}}/{{total}} 份 · <text class="link" bindtap="moreLists">查看全部 {{total}} 份</text></view>
</view>
<view style="height: 80rpx"></view>
